.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH sqop-inline-sign 1 "February 2025" "sqop 0.38.0" 
.SH "نام (NAME)"
sqop\-inline\-sign \- Creates Inline\-Signed Messages
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBsqop inline\-sign\fR [\fB\-\-debug\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-armor\fR] [\fB\-\-as\fR] [\fB\-\-with\-key\-password\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fIKEYS\fR] 
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Creates Inline\-Signed Messages
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
\fB\-\-debug\fR
Emit verbose output for debugging
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-armor\fR
Don\*(Aqt ASCII\-armor output
.TP
\fB\-\-as\fR \fI<AS>\fR [default: binary]
Sign binary data, UTF\-8 text, or using the Cleartext Signature Framework
.TP
\fB\-\-with\-key\-password\fR \fI<WITH_KEY_PASSWORD>\fR
Try to decrypt the signing KEYS with these passwords
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
[\fIKEYS\fR]
Keys for signing
